# Documentation (not needed in container)
# Issue #3104: the directory holds 130 MB, and only one file has a runtime
# reader. Menu 243 generates the SNMP MIB from the Mist OpenAPI file, and the
# operation failed on every container run while the whole directory was absent.
# The two lines below drop the directory contents and then restore that one
# file, which costs 5.3 MB. The `documentation/*` form matters: a negation
# cannot re-include a file when the parent directory itself is excluded.
documentation/*
!documentation/mist-api-openapi31json.json
docs/
docs/_build/
agents.md
SSH_GUIDE.md
run-misthelper.py

# Temporary files
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp

# Customer data patterns (security)
*customer*
*Customer*
*CUSTOMER*
*tmo*
*TMO*
*t-mobile*
*T-Mobile*

